    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="CH2a1486-start">
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1486_CHANT_001-1a.1-h" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T19:15:09.836+09:00">Volume One</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1486_CHANT_001-1a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T19:15:09.836+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1486_CHANT_001-1a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T19:15:09.836+09:00">&lt;Purifying the Spirit&gt; First</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1486_CHANT_001-1a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T19:15:09.836+09:00">The physical form,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1486_CHANT_001-1a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T19:15:09.836+09:00">is the vessel of life;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1486_CHANT_001-1a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T19:15:09.836+09:00">the mind,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1486_CHANT_001-1a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T19:15:09.836+09:00">is the master of the physical form;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1486_CHANT_001-1a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T19:15:09.836+09:00">the spirit,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1486_CHANT_001-1a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T19:15:09.836+09:00">is the treasure of the mind.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1486_CHANT_001-1a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T19:15:09.836+09:00">Therefore, when the spirit is tranquil, the mind is harmonious;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1486_CHANT_001-1a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T19:15:09.836+09:00">when the mind is harmonious, the physical form is complete.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1486_CHANT_001-1a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T19:15:09.836+09:00">When the spirit is agitated, the mind is restless;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1486_CHANT_001-1a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T19:15:09.836+09:00">when the mind is restless, the physical form is harmed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1486_CHANT_001-1a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T19:15:09.836+09:00">If you want to preserve the physical form,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1486_CHANT_001-1a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T19:15:09.836+09:00">the first priority is to regulate the spirit.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1486_CHANT_001-1a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T19:15:09.836+09:00">Therefore, cultivating the spirit with serenity and harmony</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1486_CHANT_001-1a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T19:15:09.836+09:00">leads to inner peace;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1486_CHANT_001-1a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T19:15:09.836+09:00">lodging the mind in purity and emptiness</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1486_CHANT_001-1a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T19:15:09.836+09:00">prevents it from being lured by external things.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1486_CHANT_001-1a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T19:15:09.836+09:00">When the spirit is serene and the mind is clear,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1486_CHANT_001-1a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T19:15:09.836+09:00">the physical form will be free from burdens.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1486_CHANT_001-1a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T19:15:09.836+09:00">From an empty room comes light,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1486_CHANT_001-1a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T19:15:09.836+09:00">good fortune arrives.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1486_CHANT_001-1a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T19:15:09.836+09:00">People do not look into melting metal, but look into polished mirrors,</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
